          <span class="text-secondary">collect_sources(sources=4, include_text=true) -&gt; SSRF check: 4/4 PASS (RFC1918 blocked)</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="trace-stage-block" data-stage="3">
        <div class="log-line">
          <span class="log-ts text-dim">[00:02.98]</span>
