          <div class="text-muted">[S1] Ministry Filing Archive, retrieved 2026-08-01 (SHA-256: 4b2f8a...) â€¢ Locator: page 3</div>
          <div class="text-muted">[S2] Gazette Publication Notice, retrieved 2026-08-01 (SHA-256: 9e102c...) â€¢ Locator: page 1</div>
          <div class="text-muted">[S3] Commercial Registry Extract, retrieved 2026-08-01 (SHA-256: d841ba...) â€¢ Locator: page 4</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Panel 4: JSON-RPC Protocol Contract -->
    <div class="sim-panel" id="tab-protocol" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="tab-btn-protocol" hidden>
      <div class="contract-container">
        <div class="json-comment">// Actual Stdio JSON-RPC 2.0 exchange demonstrating tools/call for 'verify_claims'</div>

        <div class="contract-block">
          <div class="contract-header font-mono text-xs">
            <span class="text-cyan font-bold">&gt; AGENT RUNTIME REQUEST (STDIN):</span>
